[{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0545","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0545.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-51741","title":"Redis ACL 选择器格式错误拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Redis 内存数据库在处理格式错误的 ACL 选择器时存在输入验证不当漏洞（CWE-20）。具有足够权限的认证用户可构造特制的 ACL 选择器，当该选择器被访问时触发服务器 panic 导致拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Redis 7.2.7 之前版本及 7.4.2 之前版本，攻击者需具备本地访问权限和高权限认证，CVSS 评分 4.4。Redis 官方已在 7.2.7 和 7.4.2 版本中修复此问题。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.4,"aliases":["CVE-2024-51741"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-06T22:15:09Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:06:13Z","remediation":"立即将 Redis 升级至 7.2.7 或 7.4.2 及以上版本，这两个版本已修复因畸形 ACL 选择器触发服务器 panic 导致拒绝服务的问题。如无法立即升级，可限制具有 ACL 管理权限的用户范围，仅允许受信任的管理员执行 ACL 操作，降低被利用风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/redis/redis/security/advisories/GHSA-prpq-rh5h-46g9","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-51741.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/97700d7e657426c8e1ee6cf44a0a2b88c60738c3/cves/2024/51xxx/CVE-2024-51741.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/bd141078a7ff2a16f9bd8cc62066eb74bbd40e0e/osv/cve/2024/UBUNTU-CVE-2024-51741.json","https://github.com/dicedb/dicedb/blob/9610c664d19aadadbe8890fde502231d677e39fc/00-RELEASENOTES","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/5c5bad6944a5db25ea7ec6daf0fae559d8266622/2024/51xxx/CVE-2024-51741.json","https://github.com/microsoft/azurelinux/blob/52e6c365c84db8afe29c8cad291c135c0605264c/specs/v/valkey/valkey.spec","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/9ba62febaf6254d72eb4667cd7923d92d2c3f9b6/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2024-51741","https://github.com/docker-hardened-images/advisories/blob/afea7c0a5537949917b618ac503f7bd64e4673bf/osv/redis/CVE-2024-51741.json.sha512","https://github.com/alpinelinux/aports/blob/6ca8a69233790aa99633b6ad5606668ac000cf96/community/redis/APKBUILD","https://github.com/ATLENA/lat-security-vulnerability/blob/bf92a123b0fc1c097e3fbf881b0e4ec63664f59b/redis/2025/CVE-2024-51741.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0545.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0525","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0525.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-46981","title":"Redis Redis Lua 库命令远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Redis 是一款开源内存数据库，其内嵌的 Lua 脚本引擎存在释放后使用（Use-After-Free）漏洞。经过身份认证的攻击者可通过 EVAL 或 EVALSHA 命令提交特制的 Lua 脚本，操纵垃圾回收器触发内存释放后的非法访问，从而在 Redis 服务器进程中实现远程代码执行。该漏洞影响 Redis 6.2.17 之前、7.2.7 之前以及 7.4.2 之前的版本，攻击需要低权限且攻击复杂度较高。官方已在 7.4.2、7.2.7 和 6.2.17 版本中修复，也可通过 ACL 限制 Lua 脚本执行作为临时缓解措施。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.0,"aliases":["CVE-2024-46981"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-06T22:15:09Z","updated":"2026-06-17T07:56:18Z","remediation":"立即升级 Redis 至 7.4.2 / 7.2.7 / 6.2.17 或更高版本。如无法升级，通过 ACL 限制 EVAL 和 EVALSHA 命令执行：在 redis.conf 中配置 `rename-command EVAL \"\"` 和 `rename-command EVALSHA \"\"`，或使用 ACL 规则 `-EVAL -EVALSHA` 禁止非受信用户执行 Lua 脚本。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/redis/redis/releases/tag/6.2.17","https://github.com/redis/redis/releases/tag/7.2.7","https://github.com/redis/redis/releases/tag/7.4.2","https://github.com/redis/redis/security/advisories/GHSA-39h2-x6c4-6w4c","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/01/msg00018.html","https://www.vicarius.io/vsociety/posts/cve-2024-46981-detect-redis-vulnerability","https://www.vicarius.io/vsociety/posts/cve-2024-46981-mitigate-redis-vulnerability","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-46981.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/c2df87babf8eed88f612cb73e25ef1a25c924358/2024/CVE-2024-46981.json","https://github.com/gelusus/wxvl/blob/fdc43b71a29cfc20dd1d437cc0240b9a31185623/doc/2025-01/%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E%E9%A2%84%E8%AD%A6%EF%BD%9CRedis%E4%BB%A3%E7%A0%81%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E(CVE-2024-46981).md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/528991f6906b29893dd0e43e65862cd92fd607c8/cves/2024/46xxx/CVE-2024-46981.json","https://github.com/dicedb/dicedb/blob/9610c664d19aadadbe8890fde502231d677e39fc/00-RELEASENOTES","https://github.com/apecloud/kubeblocks/blob/dfa97006f546b969175782280acb92d813b24ae4/docs/release_notes/v0.9.0/0.9.3.md","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/9ba62febaf6254d72eb4667cd7923d92d2c3f9b6/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2024-46981","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/4cbc1cd445b97bc2235c2b80e223e324747c59b3/osv/cve/2024/UBUNTU-CVE-2024-46981.json","https://github.com/docker-hardened-images/advisories/blob/b0c5c08da42041355ee2147ca10175ddaf598407/osv/redis/CVE-2024-46981.json.sha512","https://github.com/alpinelinux/aports/blob/72f2dfae7109a1c22fada87801e672e993ae2d77/community/redis/APKBUILD","https://github.com/publicqi/CVE-2024-46981","https://github.com/xsshk/CVE-2024-46981"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0525.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0575","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0575.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-56769","title":"Linux Kernel dib3000mb DVB前端驱动未初始化值漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 DVB 前端驱动 dib3000mb 中的 dib3000_read_reg 函数存在未初始化值漏洞。函数中局部变量 rb[2] 作为 i2c_transfer() 的读取缓冲区使用，当 I2C 传输失败时该缓冲区内容未被清零，导致未定义数据被后续流程使用，可能造成敏感信息泄露或系统崩溃。本地攻击者需具备低权限并接入 DVB USB 设备触发该漏洞，CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中等。Linux 内核主线已通过清零 rb 缓冲区修复此问题。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2024-56769"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-06T17:15:44Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:12:56Z","remediation":"立即更新 Linux 内核至包含该补丁的版本：Ubuntu 24.04 LTS 升级至 linux-image-6.11.0-1011-lowlatency（USN-7381-1），Debian 11 升级至 linux-image 6.1.0-0.deb11.22-amd64（DLA-4075-1），其他发行版更新至主线内核 v6.13-rc6 以上版本。如无法立即更新，可禁用 DVB 相关硬件或卸载 dib3000mb 驱动模块（modprobe -r dib3000mb）作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/035772fcd631eee2756b31cb6df249c0a8d453d7","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/1d6de21f00293d819b5ca6dbe75ff1f3b6392140","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/2dd59fe0e19e1ab955259978082b62e5751924c7","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/3876e3a1c31a58a352c6bf5d2a90e3304445a637","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/53106510736e734ce8b731ba871363389bfbf4c9","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/c1197c1457bb7098cf46366e898eb52b41b6876a","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/e11778189513cd7fb2edced5bd053bc18ede8418","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00001.html","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00002.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-56769.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/58bdedd85e346c3efc30a2f8424c96c50aa4db2e/cves/2024/56xxx/CVE-2024-56769.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2024/CVE-2024-56769.yaml","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2024-56769","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-56769.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/d8c79a157e22e9abda84461cbe0f59ce58612245/references/CveServices-CVE-2024-56769-2025-11-03-1439","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2024/CVE-2024-56769.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/7b14132e5983d4643412f6d4f89beb409b809e9f/CVE/data/2024/CVE-2024-56769.json","https://github.com/joaop9425/manual-do-tecnico/blob/cc6e0f5304777f18e55db554da5372bc31d4cae1/src/content/noticias/2026/02/18/seguranca/cve-2024-56769-media-dvb-frontends-dib3000mb-fix-u-1771406575000.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/7007cbf91cfd56bead27c222fc520c733ed0ad71/advisories/unreviewed/2025/01/GHSA-q23h-j65c-73m4/GHSA-q23h-j65c-73m4.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0575.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0574","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0574.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-56767","title":"Linux Kernel at_xdmac DMA 引擎空指针解引用漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 DMA 引擎 at_xdmac 驱动中存在空指针解引用漏洞（CWE-476）。在 at_xdmac_prep_dma_memset 函数中，当 at_xdmac_memset_create_desc 返回 NULL（因 len 参数错误或 atchan->free_descs_list 为空导致内存耗尽）时，未进行空指针检查直接解引用，导致内核崩溃拒绝服务。该漏洞影响使用 Atmel XDMAC DMA 控制器的 Linux 内核版本，攻击者需具备本地低权限访问权限（CVSS:3.1/AV:L/AC:L/PR:L/UI:N/S:U/C:N/I:N/A:H，CVSS 5.5 MEDIUM），通过触发异常 DMA memset 操作（如传入异常长度或耗尽内存）即可触发空指针解引用导致系统崩溃拒绝服务，可用性影响严重。Linux 内核已通过在 at_xdmac_prep_dma_memset 中增加空指针检查修复该漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2024-56767"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-06T17:15:43Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:12:56Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 Linux 内核至包含修复补丁的版本：Debian 11 升级至 linux-image-5.10.223-1 或更新版本（DLA-4075-1）；Ubuntu 24.04 LTS 升级至 linux-image-6.8.0-52-generic 或更新版本（USN-7381-1）；Ubuntu 20.04 LTS 升级至 linux-image-5.15.0-130-generic 或更新版本（USN-7459-1）；其他发行版升级至 Linux 内核 6.12.2、6.11.11、6.6.63、6.1.121、5.15.175、5.10.223、5.4.289 或更新版本。临时缓解措施：在不使用 Atmel XDMAC DMA 控制器的系统上，可通过内核启动参数禁用该驱动（modprobe.blacklist=at_xdmac）或在内核配置中禁用 CONFIG_DMA_AT_XDMAC 选项后重新编译内核。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/3d229600c54e9e0909080ecaf1aab0642aefa5f0","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/54376d8d26596f98ed7432a788314bb9154bf3e3","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/8d364597de9ce2a5f52714224bfe6c2e7a29b303","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/c43ec96e8d34399bd9dab2f2dc316b904892133f","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/e658f1c133b854b2ae799147301d82dddb8f3162","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/ed1a8aaa344522c0c349ac9042db27ad130ef913","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/fdba6d5e455388377ec7e82a5913ddfcc7edd93b","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00001.html","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00002.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-56767.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/58bdedd85e346c3efc30a2f8424c96c50aa4db2e/cves/2024/56xxx/CVE-2024-56767.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2024/CVE-2024-56767.yaml","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2024-56767","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-56767.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/d8c79a157e22e9abda84461cbe0f59ce58612245/references/CveServices-CVE-2024-56767-2025-11-03-1451","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/7b14132e5983d4643412f6d4f89beb409b809e9f/CVE/data/2024/CVE-2024-56767.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2024/CVE-2024-56767.md","https://github.com/joaop9425/manual-do-tecnico/blob/cc6e0f5304777f18e55db554da5372bc31d4cae1/src/content/noticias/2026/02/18/seguranca/cve-2024-56767-dmaengine-at-xdmac-avoid-null-prt-d-1771406472000.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/7007cbf91cfd56bead27c222fc520c733ed0ad71/advisories/unreviewed/2025/01/GHSA-c9h3-5qgq-g7wx/GHSA-c9h3-5qgq-g7wx.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0574.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0573","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0573.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-56766","title":"Linux 内核 MTD rawnand 驱动双重释放漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 MTD 子系统中的 rawnand 驱动存在双重释放（double free）漏洞，位于 atmel_pmecc_create_user() 函数中。该函数将 `user` 指针的内存分配方式从 kzalloc() 改为 devm_kzalloc() 后，仍保留了 kfree(user) 调用，导致同一内存区域被释放两次，引发内核崩溃或潜在的内存破坏。攻击者需要本地低权限访问，通过加载特制的 NAND Flash 设备触发该漏洞，可能导致系统拒绝服务或权限提升。该漏洞影响 Linux 内核多个版本，CVSS 评分 7.8，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2024-56766"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-06T17:15:43Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:12:56Z","remediation":"立即更新 Linux 内核至以下修复版本：4.20 及以上、5.4.289 及以上、5.10.233 及以上、5.15.176 及以上、6.1.123 及以上、6.6.69 及以上、6.12.8 及以上或 6.13-rc5 及以上。Debian 11 用户请安装 DLA-4075-1 安全更新；Ubuntu 24.04 LTS 用户请安装 USN-7381-1 更新（升级至 linux-image-6.11.0-1011-lowlatency 6.11.0-1011.12~24.04.1）。如无法立即更新内核，可临时限制本地低权限用户加载 Atmel NAND Flash 驱动模块（禁用 atmel_nand 内核模块加载），但建议优先安排内核升级。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/1562871ef613fa9492aa0310933eff785166a90e","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/3d825a241e65f7e3072978729e79d735ec40b80e","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/6ea15205d7e2b811fbbdf79783f686f58abfb4b7","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/ca9818554b0f33e87f38e4bfa2dac056692d46cc","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/d2f090ea57f8d6587e09d4066f740a8617767b3d","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/d8e4771f99c0400a1873235704b28bb803c83d17","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/dd45c87782738715d5e7c167f8dabf0814a7394a","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00001.html","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00002.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-56766.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/58bdedd85e346c3efc30a2f8424c96c50aa4db2e/cves/2024/56xxx/CVE-2024-56766.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2024/CVE-2024-56766.yaml","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2024-56766","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/c6c9e305761264e104c5de70e59376c519bbfef3/2024/CVE-2024-56766.md","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/75471602a53215062ddbaeb95f039a60b664c3d0/osv/cve/2024/UBUNTU-CVE-2024-56766.json","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-56766.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/d8c79a157e22e9abda84461cbe0f59ce58612245/references/CveServices-CVE-2024-56766-2025-11-03-1439","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/7b14132e5983d4643412f6d4f89beb409b809e9f/CVE/data/2024/CVE-2024-56766.json","https://github.com/joaop9425/manual-do-tecnico/blob/cc6e0f5304777f18e55db554da5372bc31d4cae1/src/content/noticias/2026/02/18/seguranca/cve-2024-56766-mtd-rawnand-fix-double-free-in-atme-1771408163000.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0573.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0572","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0572.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-56765","title":"Linux Kernel powerpc/pseries VAS 释放后使用漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 powerpc/pSeries 架构的 VAS（虚拟加速器交换板）子系统中存在释放后使用（Use-After-Free）漏洞。当用户进程通过 mmap 映射 paste 地址时，VMA 地址被保存在 VAS 窗口结构体中，用于在系统迁移时取消映射。然而，当进程调用 munmap() 解除映射后，VAS 窗口中的 VMA 地址并未同步更新，仍指向已释放的内存区域。在后续分区迁移操作中，reconfig_close_windows 函数访问该悬空指针，触发 slab-use-after-free，可能导致内核内存损坏。本地低权限攻击者可利用此漏洞造成系统崩溃或潜在的信息泄露。该漏洞影响 Linux 内核 powerpc pSeries 平台，CVSS 评分 7.8，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2024-56765"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-06T17:15:42Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:12:56Z","remediation":"立即升级 Linux 内核至以下安全版本：6.1.123、6.6.69、6.12.8 或 6.13 及以上。对应补丁提交为 05aa156e156e、6d9cd2710545、8b2282b50845、b7f60ffdfd96。Ubuntu 24.04 LTS 用户可通过 `apt update && apt install linux-image-6.11.0-1011-lowlatency` 安装 USN-7381-1 更新。Debian 用户参考 DLA-4071-1。如无法立即升级，可临时禁用 VAS 功能（`modprobe.blacklist=vas`）或避免在受影响系统上执行 LPAR 迁移操作作为缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/05aa156e156ef3168e7ab8a68721945196495c17","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/6d9cd27105459f169993a4c5f216499a946dbf34","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/8b2282b5084521254a2cd9742a3f4e1d5b77f843","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/b7f60ffdfd96f8fc826f1d61a1c6067d828e20b9","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00001.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-56765.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/58bdedd85e346c3efc30a2f8424c96c50aa4db2e/cves/2024/56xxx/CVE-2024-56765.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2024-56765","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2024/CVE-2024-56765.yaml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/dee3a736a4e988cc248dc4d7530452b86aa0546e/2024/56xxx/CVE-2024-56765.json","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-56765.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/d8c79a157e22e9abda84461cbe0f59ce58612245/references/CveServices-CVE-2024-56765-2025-11-03-1439","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2024/CVE-2024-56765.md","https://github.com/joaop9425/manual-do-tecnico/blob/cc6e0f5304777f18e55db554da5372bc31d4cae1/src/content/noticias/2026/02/18/seguranca/cve-2024-56765-powerpcpseriesvas-add-close-callbac-1771406040000.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/270a81434b1ea0c21e9b1eeeec5c62d11319dabe/advisories/unreviewed/2025/01/GHSA-f6j3-h537-397p/GHSA-f6j3-h537-397p.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0572.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0571","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0571.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-56763","title":"Linux Kernel tracing 模块输入验证不当导致拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Linux 内核的 tracing 子系统中的 tracing_cpumask_write 函数存在输入验证缺陷，当用户写入一个过大的 count 值时，会触发 bitmap_parse_user 中的告警（WARNING），导致内核崩溃。本地低权限攻击者可通过向 /sys/kernel/tracing/tracing_cpumask 写入特制的大数值触发该漏洞，造成系统拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Linux 主线内核，CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2024-56763"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-06T17:15:42Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:12:56Z","remediation":"立即将 Linux 内核升级至以下修复版本：5.10.233、5.15.176、6.1.123、6.6.69、6.12.8 或 6.13 及以上版本。对应发行版用户请安装各自厂商提供的更新包（如 Debian 用户通过 `apt update && apt upgrade` 安装 DLA-4075 更新，Ubuntu 用户安装 USN-7381-1 更新）。如无法立即升级，可通过 `echo 0 > /proc/sys/kernel/tracing_cpumask` 禁用 tracing_cpumask 写入功能作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/03041e474a6a8f1bfd4b96b164bb3165c48fa1a3","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/1cca920af19df5dd91254e5ff35e68e911683706","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/2558d753df0628d4187d8e1fd989339460f4f364","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/3d15f4c2449558ffe83b4dba30614ef1cd6937c3","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/98feccbf32cfdde8c722bc4587aaa60ee5ac33f0","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/f60172b447317cb6c5e74b5601a151866269baf6","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00001.html","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00002.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-56763.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/58bdedd85e346c3efc30a2f8424c96c50aa4db2e/cves/2024/56xxx/CVE-2024-56763.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2024/CVE-2024-56763.yaml","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2024-56763","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-56763.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/d8c79a157e22e9abda84461cbe0f59ce58612245/references/CveServices-CVE-2024-56763-2025-11-03-1439","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/7b14132e5983d4643412f6d4f89beb409b809e9f/CVE/data/2024/CVE-2024-56763.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2024/CVE-2024-56763.md","https://github.com/joaop9425/manual-do-tecnico/blob/cc6e0f5304777f18e55db554da5372bc31d4cae1/src/content/noticias/2026/02/18/seguranca/cve-2024-56763-tracing-prevent-bad-count-for-traci-1771406159000.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/3b3e0c6dace1e53ea2fb8cc49db3e38b834c9179/advisories/unreviewed/2025/01/GHSA-vj55-2cxj-5mrc/GHSA-vj55-2cxj-5mrc.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0571.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0570","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0570.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-56761","title":"Linux kernel x86 FRED 缺失 ENDBRANCH 处理导致拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 x86 FRED（灵活返回与事件分发）子系统中存在 WFE（WAIT_FOR_ENDBRANCH）状态未清除漏洞。当 CPU 间接分支跟踪器（IBT）处于 WFE 状态时，若解码器发现非 ENDBR 指令会触发 #CP 异常。FRED 机制在入口栈中保存并恢复 WFE 状态，但软件未在异常处理路径中清除该状态，导致从引发 #CP 的指令恢复执行时再次触发 #CP，形成死循环。本地攻击者可通过触发缺失 ENDBRANCH 的 #CP 异常（如运行 IBT 自测程序）造成系统拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Linux 内核 x86 架构，CVSS 评分 5.5，需本地低权限访问。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2024-56761"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-06T17:15:41Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:12:55Z","remediation":"建议立即将 Linux 内核升级至 6.6.70、6.12.8 或 6.13 及以上版本，对应补丁提交为 b939f108e86b、dc81e556f2a0、151447859d6f。Ubuntu 24.04 LTS 用户可通过 apt update && apt upgrade 安装 linux-image-6.11.0-1011-lowlatency（USN-7381-1）或 linux-image-6.8.0-1028-nvidia（USN-7514-1）修复此问题。升级后须重启系统生效。如无法立即升级，可在启动参数中添加 ibt=off 禁用 IBT 作为临时缓解措施，但会降低控制流完整性保护。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/151447859d6fb0dcce8259f0971c6e94fb801661","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/b939f108e86b76119428a6fa4e92491e09ac7867","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/dc81e556f2a017d681251ace21bf06c126d5a192","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-56761.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/58bdedd85e346c3efc30a2f8424c96c50aa4db2e/cves/2024/56xxx/CVE-2024-56761.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2024/CVE-2024-56761.yaml","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2024-56761","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-56761.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/7b14132e5983d4643412f6d4f89beb409b809e9f/CVE/data/2024/CVE-2024-56761.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2024/CVE-2024-56761.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/5965518125739d48e98f0cf3efbf7359253ff7cc/advisories/unreviewed/2025/01/GHSA-q9hp-vwf8-w58f/GHSA-q9hp-vwf8-w58f.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2024-56761","https://github.com/InfoSecREDD/CVE-Discord-Notify/blob/3f4b2b159624fda9a5cd9efcc2a46893068cd4db/seen_cves.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0570.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0569","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0569.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-56760","title":"Linux Linux Kernel PCI/MSI irqdomain 缺失处理不当导致拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 PCI/MSI 子系统中存在不恰当的 irqdomain 缺失处理缺陷。在未提供 PCI/MSI 支持的 RISCV 等平台上，当设备尝试启用 MSI-X 中断时，pci_msi_setup_msi_irqs() 函数会触发遗留回退存根（legacy fallback stub），产生内核警告并可能导致系统拒绝服务。该漏洞源于 PCI/MSI 层未能正确评估遗留模式是否启用，在缺乏 PCI/MSI 父域关联的情况下仍执行了无效的遗留回退路径。本地攻击者需具备低权限，通过触发特定设备的 MSI-X 中断请求即可利用，影响 Linux 内核各发行版本，CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2024-56760"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-06T17:15:41Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:12:55Z","remediation":"立即升级 Linux 内核至 6.6.69、6.12.8 或 6.13 及以上版本，对应内核提交 b1f7476e07b93、aed157301c65、a60b990798eb 已包含修复。Ubuntu 24.04 LTS 用户可通过 apt update && apt install linux-image-6.8.0-1028-nvidia 安装 USN-7514-1 更新，或安装 USN-7381-1 提供的 linux-image-6.11.0-1011-lowlatency 版本，更新后重启系统生效。RISC-V 平台如不支持 PCI/MSI，可在内核配置中禁用 CONFIG_PCI_MSI 以消除警告。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/a60b990798eb17433d0283788280422b1bd94b18","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/aed157301c659a48f5564cc4568cf0e5c8831af0","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/b1f7476e07b93d65a1a3643dcb4a7bed80d4328d","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-56760.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/58bdedd85e346c3efc30a2f8424c96c50aa4db2e/cves/2024/56xxx/CVE-2024-56760.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2024/CVE-2024-56760.yaml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/dee3a736a4e988cc248dc4d7530452b86aa0546e/2024/56xxx/CVE-2024-56760.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2024-56760","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2024/CVE-2024-56760.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/0b54eddb6b01c4a2bdae016ba668128b1a8b9336/advisories/unreviewed/2025/01/GHSA-7vgm-4f6w-wj5f/GHSA-7vgm-4f6w-wj5f.json","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-56760.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2024-56760","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/7b14132e5983d4643412f6d4f89beb409b809e9f/SSVC/data/2024/CVE-2024-56760.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0569.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0568","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0568.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-56759","title":"Linux 内核 btrfs 使用后释放漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 btrfs 文件系统在写时复制（COW）树块时存在释放后使用漏洞。当启用 trace_btrfs_cow_block() 跟踪点且内核开启 CONFIG_PREEMPT 时，btrfs_force_cow_block() 函数通过 free_extent_buffer_stale() 释放扩展缓冲区并调度 RCU 回收，若当前进程在调用跟踪点前被抢占，已释放的缓冲区将被访问，触发释放后使用。本地攻击者可在低权限条件下利用此漏洞实现权限提升，导致系统崩溃或信息泄露。CVSS 评分 7.8，危害等级高。受影响的包括 Ubuntu、Debian、SUSE 等主流发行版内核，各厂商已发布安全更新修复。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2024-56759"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-06T17:15:40Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:12:55Z","remediation":"更新内核到 >=5.15.0 版本（或通过发行商（Ubuntu/debian/RedHat等）提供的安全更新），或在跟踪不可用时禁用 tracepoint trace_btrfs_cow_block。Ubuntu: `sudo apt-get update && sudo apt-get install --only-upgrade linux-generic`；Debian: `apt-get update && apt-get install --only-upgrade linux-image-$(uname -r)`；Red Hat/Fedora: `dnf upgrade kernel`。如使用 Kubernetes，请确保控制平面和节点均已更新。内核 5.15+ 包含内核 commit 994a2d51f21668bcbb5e7da3b47050d806cf4a08 的修复。实时跟踪如非必须可选禁用：`echo 0 > /sys/kernel/debug/tracing/events/btrfs/trace_btrfs_cow_block/enable`","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/44f52bbe96dfdbe4aca3818a2534520082a07040","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/526ff5b27f090fb15040471f892cd2c9899ce314","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/66376f1a73cba57fd0af2631d7888605b738e499","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/9a466b8693b9add05de99af00c7bdff8259ecf19","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/ba5120a2fb5f23b4d39d302e181aa5d4e28a90d1","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/c3a403d8ce36f5a809a492581de5ad17843e4701","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00001.html","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00002.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-56759.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/58bdedd85e346c3efc30a2f8424c96c50aa4db2e/cves/2024/56xxx/CVE-2024-56759.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2024/CVE-2024-56759.yaml","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2024-56759","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/dee3a736a4e988cc248dc4d7530452b86aa0546e/2024/56xxx/CVE-2024-56759.json","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/c6c9e305761264e104c5de70e59376c519bbfef3/2024/CVE-2024-56759.md","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-56759.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/d8c79a157e22e9abda84461cbe0f59ce58612245/references/CveServices-CVE-2024-56759-2025-11-03-1439","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fc954c015ec74fa656f6d2cb3eaa86c83e860239/advisories/unreviewed/2025/01/GHSA-6574-vqv8-9334/GHSA-6574-vqv8-9334.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2024-56759"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0568.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0567","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0567.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-56758","title":"Linux Kernel btrfs 空指针解引用漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 btrfs 文件系统在 relocate_one_folio() 函数中存在条件竞争漏洞。当调用 btrfs_read_folio() 读取 folio 时，该 folio 会被解锁，此时其他线程可能通过 invalidate_inode_pages2() 修改映射并将 mapping 置为 NULL。若后续未重新检查 folio 映射有效性就直接调用 set_extent_mapping()，将导致空指针解引用，引发内核崩溃。本地低权限攻击者可通过并发触发 btrfs 块组重定位与事务中止操作来利用此漏洞，造成系统拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Linux 内核 btrfs 文件系统，CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2024-56758"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-06T17:15:40Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:12:55Z","remediation":"建议立即升级内核至修复版本：SUSE Linux Enterprise 15 SP6 Azure 内核升级至 SUSE-SU-2025:1177-1 版本，SUSE Linux Enterprise 15 SP7 升级至 SUSE-SU-2025:01967-1 或 SUSE-SU-2025:01951-1 版本，Ubuntu 24.04 LTS 升级至 USN-7381-1 提供的内核版本，Debian 12 升级至 DSA-5973 提供的内核版本，Microsoft CBL-Mariner/Azure Linux 升级至 AZL-55032 修复版本。如无法立即升级内核，可暂时卸载或禁用 btrfs 文件系统模块（modprobe -r btrfs 并加入黑名单 /etc/modprobe.d/blacklist-btrfs.conf），或避免在 btrfs 卷上执行 balance/relocate 操作作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/36679fab54fa7bcffafd469e2c474c1fc4beaee0","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/3e74859ee35edc33a022c3f3971df066ea0ca6b9","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/c7b1bd52a031ad0144d42eef0ba8471ce75122dd","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/d508e56270389b3a16f5b3cf247f4eb1bbad1578","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/10/msg00008.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-56758.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/58bdedd85e346c3efc30a2f8424c96c50aa4db2e/cves/2024/56xxx/CVE-2024-56758.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2024-56758","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2024/CVE-2024-56758.yaml","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/c6c9e305761264e104c5de70e59376c519bbfef3/2024/CVE-2024-56758.md","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-56758.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/d8c79a157e22e9abda84461cbe0f59ce58612245/references/CveServices-CVE-2024-56758-2025-11-03-1121","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/ad583e79ed38e32f21eec5f8962c8f59146c10bc/CVE/data/2024/CVE-2024-56758.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2024-56758","https://github.com/microsoft/AzureLinuxVulnerabilityData/blob/49fc6c5c0668d68233834d9d61b1c916248edd25/osv/AZL-55032.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0567.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0566","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0566.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-56757","title":"Linux 内核 btusb 驱动 USB 断开时接口未释放导致内核崩溃漏洞","description":"Linux 内核蓝牙子系统 btusb 驱动中，MediaTek 芯片组为 ISO 数据传输声明了一个专用 USB 中断接口，但在 USB 断开连接时未正确释放该接口即注销 HCI 设备，导致资源释放顺序错误。本地具有低权限的攻击者可通过物理移除 MediaTek 蓝牙 USB 适配器触发此缺陷，造成内核崩溃（Kernel Panic），导致拒绝服务。该漏洞影响使用 MediaTek 蓝牙芯片的 Linux 系统，CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2024-56757"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-06T17:15:40Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:12:55Z","remediation":"升级 Linux 内核至 6.12.8 或更高版本（6.13 已包含修复），或合入补丁 commit cc569d791ab2a / 489304e67087。Ubuntu 24.04 LTS 用户执行 `apt update && apt install linux-image-$(uname -r | sed 's/-generic//')-generic` 安装 USN-7381-1 更新。临时缓解措施：避免在蓝牙 ISO 数据传输过程中热拔插 MediaTek BT USB 适配器。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/489304e67087abddc2666c5af0159cb95afdcf59","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/cc569d791ab2a0de74f76e470515d25d24c9b84b","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/58bdedd85e346c3efc30a2f8424c96c50aa4db2e/cves/2024/56xxx/CVE-2024-56757.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2024/CVE-2024-56757.yaml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/dee3a736a4e988cc248dc4d7530452b86aa0546e/2024/56xxx/CVE-2024-56757.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2024-56757","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2024-56757.md","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/75471602a53215062ddbaeb95f039a60b664c3d0/osv/cve/2024/UBUNTU-CVE-2024-56757.json","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-56757.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/881714b7d8a541e04c5fbc03cede9cc635f1aa2c/advisories/unreviewed/2025/01/GHSA-gw7h-65mp-jqvp/GHSA-gw7h-65mp-jqvp.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2024-56757","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/ad583e79ed38e32f21eec5f8962c8f59146c10bc/SSVC/data/2024/CVE-2024-56757.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0566.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0010","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0010.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-11148","title":"OpenBSD httpd(8) fastcgi 请求处理空指针解引用拒绝服务漏洞","description":"OpenBSD httpd(8) 在处理格式错误的 fastcgi 请求时存在空指针解引用漏洞。当攻击者向受影响版本的 OpenBSD httpd 服务器发送特制的畸形 fastcgi 请求时，程序未能正确校验指针便进行解引用操作，导致守护进程崩溃并触发拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 OpenBSD 7.4（低于修正补丁 006）及 OpenBSD 7.3（低于修正补丁 020）。攻击者无需身份认证，只需能与 httpd 服务端口建立网络连接即可远程发起攻击，利用方式是通过构造不符合协议的 fastcgi 报文使服务不可用。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.7,"aliases":["CVE-2024-11148"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2024-12-05T20:15:21Z","updated":"2026-06-17T06:57:10Z","remediation":"升级到已修复版本：OpenBSD 7.4 应用 2024 年 1 月发布的 errata 006 补丁，或 OpenBSD 7.3 应用 errata 020 补丁（执行 sysmerge 并重新编译/更新 httpd 二进制）；如暂无法打补丁，可在 httpd.conf 中通过限制 fastcgi 后端仅接受来自本地/可信网络的请求、或在前端反向代理处过滤畸形 fastcgi 请求以缓解拒绝服务风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-17T00:00:00Z","references":["https://ftp.openbsd.org/pub/OpenBSD/patches/7.3/common/020_httpd.patch.sig","https://ftp.openbsd.org/pub/OpenBSD/patches/7.4/common/006_httpd.patch.sig","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/64fd197c5b8f3e4f9493cb07798bdca54583505c/cves/2024/11xxx/CVE-2024-11148.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/bd8147c9eb98061a73ac3211bfcd9edfb4e5605b/2024/11xxx/CVE-2024-11148.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/e046e4965f64348bd29a0c62edd023b3c580939e/content/CVE-2024-11148.md","https://github.com/adysec/hwpoc/blob/760f2a0ac5ec983dd84c5e09cb5339a52f81c82b/docs/2026/OpenBSD_httpd_fastcgi_NULL_%E8%A7%A3%E5%BC%95%E7%94%A8%E6%8B%92%E7%BB%9D%E6%9C%8D%E5%8A%A1%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E_CVE-2024-11148.toml","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/2e86ccb45bad26f6ff984e676f6d08b925d0e6ee/advisories/unreviewed/2024/12/GHSA-6xw3-v997-r9fc/GHSA-6xw3-v997-r9fc.json","https://github.com/Hashmire/cpeApplicabilityGeneratorPages/blob/4588dccb1f913705444975eb2a5eb79962bf2513/generated_pages/CVE-2024-11148.html","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f71c1815da5fc1872d1d999eebe8b28a9e3854c7/SSVC/data/2024/CVE-2024-11148.json","https://github.com/xhls008/nvd_yesterday/blob/0e35d8bfdac0b27bd17f876ef30e25bea2c2e02d/CVEs_log/2024-12-06_zh.md","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--472bd70c-93e6-4470-ac18-c1af86a984d5.json","https://github.com/jgamblin/cvelint-action/blob/b6cfdffaf454975251cf1f60982a431e914883e8/CNAReports/cisa-cg.csv","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2024-11148"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0010.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0009","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0009.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-10500","title":"绿盟亿赛通 CDG HookWhiteListService SQL 注入漏洞","description":"绿盟亿赛通（ESAFENET）CDG 数据泄露防护系统 5 版本在 /com/esafenet/servlet/policy/HookWhiteListService.java 中存在 SQL 注入漏洞。该接口对用户传入的 policyId 参数未做有效过滤与参数化校验，攻击者可构造包含恶意 SQL 片段（如注入 WAITFOR DELAY 延时语句）的请求，向 /CDGServer3/policy/HookWhiteList;logindojojs 接口发起远程未授权访问，从而探测数据库名、执行任意 SQL 查询并可能导致数据库信息泄露。此漏洞可经网络远程利用，无需身份认证，CVSS 评分为 5.3，危害等级为中。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.3,"aliases":["CVE-2024-10500"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2024-10-30T01:15:02Z","updated":"2026-06-17T06:55:48Z","remediation":"建议升级到 ESAFENET CDG 官方已修复该 SQL 注入漏洞的版本（联系厂商获取 CDG 5 后续补丁/安全版本）。如暂时无法升级，应在 Web 应用防火墙（WAF）中拦截对 /com/esafenet/servlet/policy/HookWhiteListService 路径含 policyId 参数的恶意请求，并对 policyId 参数做严格白名单校验与预编译参数化查询，同时限制该接口仅允许内网可信地址访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-17T00:00:00Z","references":["https://flowus.cn/share/a582f7be-7e33-41f1-bce9-a1eb3578229f?code=G8A6P3","https://vuldb.com/?ctiid.282440","https://vuldb.com/?id.282440","https://vuldb.com/?submit.427397","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/64fd197c5b8f3e4f9493cb07798bdca54583505c/cves/2024/10xxx/CVE-2024-10500.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/bd8147c9eb98061a73ac3211bfcd9edfb4e5605b/2024/10xxx/CVE-2024-10500.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/e046e4965f64348bd29a0c62edd023b3c580939e/content/CVE-2024-10500.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/2e86ccb45bad26f6ff984e676f6d08b925d0e6ee/advisories/unreviewed/2024/10/GHSA-xgxf-923g-4wjc/GHSA-xgxf-923g-4wjc.json","https://github.com/dholdaway/AI-Web-Scraper/blob/9d4bfeff24174d1776d2dafe28e134f316fef3a3/ollama_crawler/cve_results/CVE-2024-10487/secondary_content/CVE-2024-10500_secondary.txt","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f71c1815da5fc1872d1d999eebe8b28a9e3854c7/SSVC/data/2024/CVE-2024-10500.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--579b26f4-636d-4873-8ca1-078ae5c8e36f.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2024/CVE-2024-10500.json","https://github.com/aboutcode-org/aboutcode-mirror-euvd/blob/6fab7ea6c1d74d21cbcf0ffe9da81cc6b978c360/advisories/2024/10/EUVD-2024-33152.json","https://github.com/password123456/nvd-cve-database/blob/60fbe1ba6ab41a303e40d274bf566bb1d2b794d3/2024/2024-10/2024-10-30/20241030_1730253626.json","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2024-10500"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0009.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0007","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0007.toml","cve_id":"无","title":"浙江大华 智能云网关注册管理平台 SQL注入漏洞","description":"浙江大华技术股份有限公司智能云网关注册管理平台的登录接口存在SQL注入漏洞，未经认证的远程攻击者通过向/index.php/User/doLogin接口发送特制POST请求，在username参数中构造恶意SQL语句，利用updatexml报错函数可触发数据库错误回显，从而窃取数据库中的敏感信息，如管理员凭证、用户数据等。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["NUCLEI-HTTP-CNVD-2024-CNVD-2024-38747-YAML","CNVD-2024-38747"],"sources":["cnvd","nuclei"],"published":"2024-10-22T00:00:00Z","updated":"2024-10-23T00:00:00Z","remediation":"厂商已发布安全更新，建议用户立即升级智能云网关注册管理平台至最新版本；同时应在Web应用防火墙上配置规则拦截含updatexml、extractvalue等报错注入特征的POST请求，并改用参数化查询或预编译语句处理用户输入，防止SQL注入攻击。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-15T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cnvd/2024/CNVD-2024-38747.yaml","https://blog.csdn.net/qq_39894062/article/details/142982815"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0007.toml"}]